notes.content:
Fellow Mind Gamers!

We recently released new build with long awaited changes:
- level completion counter now works properly;
- no more black screen for international locales!
- level progress includes skipped levels, but it is updated only upon solving a level;
- misc fixes and improvements;

Enjoy!

